{"id":"s2.1.5","slug":"special-integers","title":"Special Integers","content":"<p class=\"mb-4\">Certain integers have special properties and factorizations that are frequently used in problems. Memorizing these can turn a complex multiplication into a simple one.</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-4\"><li><strong>999 = 27 × 37</strong>. (Used for problems with multiples of 37 or 27, like 333, 111, etc.)</li><li><strong>1001 = 7 × 11 × 13</strong>. (This is useful for divisibility and multiplication involving these primes). Numbers like 77, 143, etc., are derived from this.</li><li><strong>10101 = 3 × 7 × 13 × 37</strong>. (Used for divisibility and multiplication involving these primes).</li></ul><p>For example, to solve $1443 \\times 56$, you can recognize that $1443 = \\frac{10101}{7}$. So the problem becomes $\\frac{10101}{7} \\times 56 = 10101 \\times 8 = 80808$.</p>","summary":"Certain integers have special properties and factorizations that are frequently used in problems.","generation_guideline":"Generate a problem that uses the special properties of numbers like 999, 1001, or 10101.","questions":[{"id":1,"text":"Calculate $572 \\times 21$.","answer":"12012","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":2,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{2}{37} \\times 999$.","answer":"54","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","fractions"]},{"id":3,"text":"Calculate $33.67 \\times 15$.","answer":"505.05","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":4,"text":"Calculate $715 \\times 35$.","answer":"25025","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":5,"text":"Calculate $3367 \\times 21$.","answer":"70707","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":6,"text":"Calculate $1073 \\div 29$.","answer":"37","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":7,"text":"Calculate $715 \\times 28$.","answer":"20020","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":8,"text":"Calculate $429 \\times 35$.","answer":"15015","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":9,"text":"Calculate $63 \\times 429$.","ans